thrm{T},\\mu,\\nu,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(R,A,B,X,Y,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{T},\\mu,\\nu,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{X\\times Y}\">\\(\\sigma_{X\\times Y}\\)</span> (generated-sigma-algebra operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"58-df-sigma-generated\">58-df-sigma-generated</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10ProductMeasureRectangle}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10ProductMeasureRectangle}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot:[0,\\infty]^2\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\odot:[0,\\infty]^2\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a> 中的非负乘法；特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\odot\\infty=\\infty\\odot0=0\">\\(0\\odot\\infty=\\infty\\odot0=0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}product\\text{-}measure\\text{-}rectangle} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10ProductMeasureRectangle}_S(R,A,B,X,Y,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{T},\\mu,\\nu,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(Y,\\mathrm{T},\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\!\\left(X\\times Y,\\sigma_{X\\times Y}(\\{A&#39;\\times B&#39;:A&#39;\\in\\Sigma\\land B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{T}\\}),\\lambda\\right)\\land\\forall A&#39;\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{T}\\;(\\lambda(A&#39;\\times B&#39;)=\\mu(A&#39;)\\odot\\nu(B&#39;))\\land A\\in\\Sigma\\land B\\in\\mathrm{T}\\land R=A\\times B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}product\\text{-}measure\\text{-}rectangle} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10ProductMeasureRectangle}_S(R,A,B,X,Y,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{T},\\mu,\\nu,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(Y,\\mathrm{T},\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\!\\left(X\\times Y,\\sigma_{X\\times Y}(\\{A&#39;\\times B&#39;:A&#39;\\in\\Sigma\\land B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{T}\\}),\\lambda\\right)\\land\\forall A&#39;\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{T}\\;(\\lambda(A&#39;\\times B&#39;)=\\mu(A&#39;)\\odot\\nu(B&#39;))\\land A\\in\\Sigma\\land B\\in\\mathrm{T}\\land R=A\\times B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary product measure rectangle definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-generated","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-generated]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":